    <string key="card.name">Dubai Loop</string>
    <string key="card.text">The Dubai Frame, the Museum of the Future, Burj Khalifa, the Marina and Ain Dubai, then back along Jumeirah past Burj Al Arab. Speed cameras and Salik gates.</string>
