    <string key="page.alt">Driving through Dubai</string>
    <string key="page.blurb">From the Dubai Frame down Sheikh Zayed Road to the Marina, then back along Jumeirah. The cameras show no mercy and Salik gates add up.</string>
    <string key="page.T_MAPNOTE">The road roughly follows real places in Dubai. The horn makes the car ahead move over.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R1S">Pick a trip between Dubai landmarks, from the Frame to Burj Khalifa to the Marina, and reach the end.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R3S">Cameras flash above 120 km/h, Salik gates charge you, and crashes damage the car.</string>
